# The BuildKit named context `lekhjs` of lbs/deploy/build.sh (spec 01 §6.3,
# spec 10 §10.2). A named context does not read lbs/.dockerignore, so this
# file is what keeps the transfer small. The image copies only package.json,
# dist/, fonts/ and stencils/; the sources are covered by dist/build-info.json's
# files_sha256, which build.sh checks before docker runs.
node_modules
src
test
parity
coverage
*.log
**/*.log
